Output shot5.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set FontFamily "DejaVu Sans Mono"
Set Width 1600
Set Height 4600
Set Padding 28
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 8ms
Set CursorBlink false

Hide
Type `cd /tmp/nuru-487-clean && export PATH="$PWD:$PATH" && export PS1='$ ' && clear` Enter
Show
Type "./app -i" Enter
Sleep 700ms
Type "greet Nuru" Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "deploy prod --tag 3.0.0" Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "key-bindings --profile Emacs" Enter
Sleep 1s
Sleep 1s
